# Server deploy path

Production app directory on Hostinger VPS:

```bash
cd /var/www/vsp-task-management
```

- Repo/folder name on server: `vsp-task-management`
- Local Windows path: `d:\wamp64\www\VSP-CRM`
- Never use placeholder paths like `/path/to/...` in deploy instructions
